        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Esta Charkham, Helen Slater\n- Works: Supergirl, Chariots of Fire, Robin of Sherwood\n- Roles: producer, casting director, lead role\n- Topics: superhero films\n\nFacts:\n- Esta Malka Charkham was born on 29 March 1949 and is a British television and film producer and casting director.\n- Esta Charkham is known for the film \"Chariots of Fire\" (1981).\n- In 1984, Esta Charkham was known for the film \"Supergirl\" and the television series \"Robin of Sherwood\".\n- The 1984 film \"Supergirl\" was the first superhero film to feature a woman in the lead role.\n- Helen Slater played the title role in the 1984 film \"Supergirl\".\n- Helen Slater later returned to the TV series \"Supergirl\".",
